  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 17a73f76e324318e5907c19d3b066f8c, type: 3}
  m_Name: PlaceFoundation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TowerDefence.Battlefield::TowerDefence.Battlefield.TutorialDefinition
  Id: PlaceFoundation
  Title: Navy foundations
  Pages:
  - Choose a Navy foundation, point at a green ocean cell, and press the right trigger
    to place it. Keep shipping lanes clear. Normal foundations have no range bonus;
    medium gives 1.25x and high gives 1.75x. Right grip cancels without spending
    Money.
  - In physical mode the panel hides when you choose a build item. You can move while
    placing. X opens the panel again.
